    "detailed_description": "Field Tactics is a Turn-Based Tactical War Simulator inspired by ancient warfare. Set up your formations, utilise a variety of tactics and lead your army to victory.<br><br>Your goal is to either capture the enemy Commander or annihilate the rest of their army.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204570/extras/fcddbc9333ebfce01e916ecc393e048d.poster.avif?t=1725312598\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204570/extras/fcddbc9333ebfce01e916ecc393e048d.webm?t=1725312598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204570/extras/fcddbc9333ebfce01e916ecc393e048d.mp4?t=1725312598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Match Types</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Online Casual:</strong> Play without risking your reputation, it is the perfect arena to test new and innovative strategies against worthy opponents.<br><br></li><li><strong>Online Ranked:</strong> Test your mettle and etch your name into the annals of history. Use every strategy in your arsenal to come one step closer to becoming a Grand Commander.<br><br></li><li><strong>Local:</strong> An opportunity to play away from the prying eyes of your enemies. Formulate new and exciting plans, or perhaps just a friendly contest between members of your inner circle.<br><br></li><li><strong>AI:</strong> Experiment without giving anything away to those whose eyes watch like a hawk. Or use it to keep your mind sharp while members of your inner circle are otherwise occupied.<br><br></li><li><strong>Conquest:</strong> Battle your way through the land, prove your might on all terrains and claim the title of Grand Commander.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Pieces</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Foot Soldier:</strong> The most common piece on the battlefield, they are hard workers who can and will give their all for victory.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204570/extras/d9f340cd9a6cab4d27801d85a0e1cb5a.poster.avif?t=1725312598\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204570/extras/d9f340cd9a6cab4d27801d85a0e1cb5a.webm?t=1725312598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204570/extras/d9f340cd9a6cab4d27801d85a0e1cb5a.mp4?t=1725312598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br></li><li><strong>Archer:</strong> A vital piece in the army, they watch over the front lines and prey on those that would dare to step too close.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204570/extras/e47bec400380c9a60e6e6fa521644bf0.poster.avif?t=1725312598\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204570/extras/e47bec400380c9a60e6e6fa521644bf0.webm?t=1725312598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204570/extras/e47bec400380c9a60e6e6fa521644bf0.mp4?t=1725312598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br></li><li><strong>Chariot:</strong> They have the potential to be the most devastating weapon. Once they get going, they can't be stopped and will mow down everything in their path.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204570/extras/2325ad18cc8e5a63889e79b93b415db6.poster.avif?t=1725312598\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204570/extras/2325ad18cc8e5a63889e79b93b415db6.webm?t=1725312598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204570/extras/2325ad18cc8e5a63889e79b93b415db6.mp4?t=1725312598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br></li><li><strong>Lieutenant:</strong> The most loyal subordinates to the Commander, they are best at controlling the flow of the battle and creating sparks that can turn into a great blaze.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204570/extras/95f7f449c9c8dd56566fab11f1b21364.poster.avif?t=1725312598\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204570/extras/95f7f449c9c8dd56566fab11f1b21364.webm?t=1725312598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204570/extras/95f7f449c9c8dd56566fab11f1b21364.mp4?t=1725312598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br></li><li><strong>Commander:</strong> The Commander can fly across the battlefield, turning the tide at any given moment. But be careful, as diving too deep could land them in the enemy's trap.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204570/extras/c6a46822cb6cca9ab451dd750ef718b1.poster.avif?t=1725312598\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204570/extras/c6a46822cb6cca9ab451dd750ef718b1.webm?t=1725312598\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204570/extras/c6a46822cb6cca9ab451dd750ef718b1.mp4?t=1725312598\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></li></ul>",
